---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, "");
---

<Layout>
  <Header />

  <main class="case-study">
    <div class="case-study__container">
      <!-- Back Button -->
      <a href={`${base}/#projects`} class="back-link">&larr; Back to portfolio</a>

      <!-- Header / Executive Summary -->
      <header class="case-study__header">
        <p class="eyebrow">Case Study &bull; Business Intelligence &amp; People Analytics</p>
        <h1>Digital Health &amp; Workplace Wellbeing</h1>
        <p class="lead">
          Interactive Power BI audit and dashboard evaluating digital overexposure,
          identifying burnout risk profiles, and measuring protective factors across 3,500 cases.
        </p>

        <div class="quick-facts">
          <div class="fact-card">
            <span class="fact-label">Role</span>
            <span class="fact-value">BI &amp; Data Analyst</span>
          </div>
          <div class="fact-card">
            <span class="fact-label">Focus</span>
            <span class="fact-value">DAX Modeling &amp; Audit</span>
          </div>
          <div class="fact-card">
            <span class="fact-label">Stack</span>
            <span class="fact-value">Power BI, DAX, Python</span>
          </div>
          <div class="fact-card">
            <span class="fact-label">Deliverable</span>
            <a href="https://github.com/RenatoSaldivia/BI_Dashboard_Salud_Bienestar" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="fact-link">
              GitHub Repository &rarr;
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </header>

      <!-- Context -->
      <section class="section-block">
        <h2>1. Context &amp; Business Question</h2>
        <p>
          Heavy reliance on mobile devices and workplace platforms has increased the risk of cognitive fatigue and burnout. The challenge was to consolidate 3,500 evaluations to answer three core questions:
        </p>
        <p>
          At how many daily screen hours does critical risk spike? What real impact does physical exercise have as a biological buffer? Which job roles show higher baseline stress?
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- KPI Metrics Strip -->
      <section class="section-block">
        <h2>2. Key Study Metrics</h2>
        <div class="kpi-grid">
          <div class="kpi-box">
            <span class="kpi-number">3,500</span>
            <span class="kpi-label">Evaluated Cases</span>
          </div>
          <div class="kpi-box kpi-box--danger">
            <span class="kpi-number">20.1%</span>
            <span class="kpi-label">Critical High-Risk Rate</span>
          </div>
          <div class="kpi-box">
            <span class="kpi-number">7.3 hrs</span>
            <span class="kpi-label">Avg. Daily Screen Time</span>
          </div>
          <div class="kpi-box kpi-box--warning">
            <span class="kpi-number">-56 min</span>
            <span class="kpi-label">Sleep Deficit (vs. baseline)</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Visual Evidence Gallery -->
      <section class="section-block">
        <h2>3. Visualization &amp; Control Panel</h2>
        <p class="section-desc">
          Interactive Power BI report built with a dark mode theme and functional contrast:
        </p>

        <div class="visual-grid">
          <!-- Main Dashboard View -->
          <article class="visual-card">
            <div class="visual-media">
              <img 
                src={`${base}/images/projects/bi-dashboard/dashboard-preview.png`} 
                alt="Digital Health and Workplace Wellbeing Power BI Monitor" 
                loading="lazy"
              />
            </div>
            <div class="visual-caption">
              <span class="step-tag">Core Deliverable</span>
              <h3>Executive Risk &amp; Productivity Monitor</h3>
              <p>
                Four-quadrant layout with dynamic regional and device filtering, enabling segmentation of risk concentration patterns and physiological recovery responses.
              </p>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Conclusions -->
      <section class="section-block callout-block">
        <h2>Key Findings &amp; DAX Modeling</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Critical Exposure Threshold:</strong> The share of high-risk cases rises sharply above 10 daily screen hours, jumping from a 12%–14% baseline to concentrations above 60%.</li>
          <li><strong>Physical Protective Effect:</strong> Getting 5 or more days of weekly physical activity mitigates stress spikes and keeps sleep quality above 2.8/4.0.</li>
          <li><strong>Centralized Logic:</strong> Parameterized calculations in standalone DAX measures (<code>Total Evaluados</code>, <code>Casos Alto Riesgo</code>, <code>% Alto Riesgo</code>, <code>Prom Horas Pantalla</code>) to ensure scalability.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="actions">
          <a href="https://github.com/RenatoSaldivia/BI_Dashboard_Salud_Bienestar" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn--primary">
            View Project on GitHub
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .case-study {
    padding: 5rem 1.5rem 8rem;
    background: #0f172a;
    color: #cbd5e1;
    min-height: 100vh;
  }

  .case-study__container {
    width: min(900px, 100%);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .back-link {
    display: inline-block;
    color: #60a5fa;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    color: white;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    color: #60a5fa;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem);
    color: white;
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #94a3b8;
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
  }

  .quick-facts {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
    background: #111c30;
    border: 1px solid #1e293b;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }

  .fact-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .fact-label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #64748b;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  .fact-value {
    color: white;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }

  .fact-link {
    color: #60a5fa;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }

  .fact-link:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .section-block {
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  h2 {
    color: white;
    font-size: 1.7rem;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #1e293b;
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .section-desc {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .kpi-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
  }

  .kpi-box {
    background: #111c30;
    border: 1px solid #1e293b;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .kpi-number {
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #38bdf8;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .kpi-box--danger .kpi-number {
    color: #fb7185;
  }

  .kpi-box--warning .kpi-number {
    color: #f59e0b;
  }

  .kpi-label {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: #94a3b8;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .visual-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2.5rem;
  }

  .visual-card {
    background: #111c30;
    border: 1px solid #1e293b;
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .visual-media {
    width: 100%;
    background: #090e1a;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 1rem;
  }

  .visual-media img {
    width: 100%;
    max-height: 540px;
    object-fit: contain;
    display: block;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .visual-caption {
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }

  .visual-caption h3 {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    color: white;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }

  .visual-caption p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .step-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #60a5fa;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .callout-block {
    background: #111c30;
    border: 1px solid #2563eb;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 2rem;
  }

  .callout-block h2 {
    border-bottom: none;
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .callout-block ul {
    margin: 1rem 0 2rem;
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .callout-block li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .actions {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.8rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform 0.2s;
  }

  .btn--primary {
    background: #2563eb;
    color: white;
  }

  .btn--primary:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }
</style>